<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103144" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερετ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hum</i> a tune, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερετιῶ τι πτιστικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phryn.Com.
					14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Teles
				p.7
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				918a30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				9.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.55
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ δίχορδον τ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Euphro
				1.34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὸς αὑτῷ τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				27.15
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.99
			</span></i> K. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>tunitter</i>, of swallows, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>accompany</i> with the voice, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ αὐτὸ μέλος ᾄδειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>talk idly, prattle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.23
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντερ-</span>.
		(Onomatop.)</div>
